{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/5ad3675aa02ffa2a72cb73f15e477f1e.avif?t=1769077205\" width=1560 height=576 /></span>SQUADX proudly presents <strong>MUAY THAI XTREME</strong>, the world\u2019s first multiplayer fighting game fully dedicated to the art of Muay Thai. Designed with authenticity, tactical depth, and competitive intensity, it\u2019s more than a fighting game\u2014it\u2019s the ultimate Muay Thai experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You\u2019ll Get,\u00a0</strong>When you purchase MUAY THAI XTREME, you gain access to:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/de1bd47dae674a4444ef6614a538b9cf.avif?t=1769077205\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras_big/de1bd47dae674a4444ef6614a538b9cf.avif?t=1769077205 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked online battles: Prove your skill against fighters worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual matches: Train or spar with friends without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies: Create custom matches for your community.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/09d86bbbe3c33c895a001f9989268dc2.avif?t=1769077205\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras_big/09d86bbbe3c33c895a001f9989268dc2.avif?t=1769077205 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Fighting Styles</strong><br>Choose from multiple <strong>Tactical Styles</strong>, each inspired by real Muay Thai techniques, offering unique strengths, combos, and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisive Move</strong>: Turn the tide with game-changing finishing techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weak Posture</strong>: Exploit openings with perfectly timed attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corner Pressure</strong>: Dominate opponents with authentic Muay Thai clinch and ring control.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter Customization</strong><br>Build your own warrior\u2014personalize appearance, gear, stance, and even entrance flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arenas</strong><br>Fight across multiple stadiums inspired by legendary Muay Thai venues, from underground gyms to grand arenas.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pre-Season: No Surrender</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By joining early, you\u2019ll be part of the exclusive <strong>Pre-Season event</strong>, which includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal challenges and exclusive rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Pre-Season cosmetics that won\u2019t return after launch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pre-Season marks the beginning of our journey. As we move toward full launch, expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Tactical Styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional arenas and events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced progression systems and career features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970720/extras/1a7